{"sourceUrl":"https://yzb.xauat.edu.cn/info/1020/8176.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:10.825465+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://yzb.xauat.edu.cn/info/1020/8176.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>西安建筑科技大学土木工程学院成立于</span>1956<span>年，由原东北工学院建筑系、西北工学院土木系、青岛工学院土木系和苏南工业专科学校土木系科</span></span><span><span>整建制</span></span><span><span>合并组成</span></span><span><span>，时为建筑工程系</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>1999</span><span>年，在原建筑工程系和总图设计与运输工程专业基础上组建了土木工程学院。</span></span><span><span>学院拥有土木工程一级学科博士后科研流动站</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>土木工程一级学科博士</span></span><span><span>学位授权</span></span><span><span>点</span></span><span><span>、土木水利博士专业学位授权点、资源与环境博士专业学位授权点</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>1981</span><span>年结构工程专业获全国首批博士、硕士学位授予权，</span></span><span>2002<span>年结构工程学科被评为国家重点学科，是我国西北地区唯一的国家重点学科。</span><span>2013</span><span>年，学院主持的教育部首批</span></span><span><span>“建筑与土木工程领域工程硕士专业学位研究生教育综合改革试点项目”以“优秀”</span></span><span><span>等级通过验收。土木工程学科在</span></span><span><span>2016</span><span>年全国</span></span><span><span>第四轮学科评估中</span></span><span><span>位列</span></span><span>B+<span>，</span></span><span><span>2021</span><span>年全国</span></span><span><span>第五轮学科评估中</span></span><span><span>进入</span><span>A</span><span>类序列</span></span><span><span>，入选</span>2021</span><span><span>年、</span><span>2024</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>“软科世界一流学科排名”</span></span><span><span>榜单，位列</span></span><span><span>“2022软科中国最好学科排名”前</span></span><span>10%<span>，所在</span></span><span><span>的</span></span><span><span>工程学为全球前</span>1‰<span>学科。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院现有土木工程国家级实验教学示范中心、土木工程国家级虚拟仿真实验教学中心、西北地区建筑与土木工程领域研究生联合培养国家级示范基地、西部绿色建筑国家重点实验室（结构中心）、</span></span><span><span>国家级高等学校学科创新引智基地、</span></span><span><span>结构工程与抗震教育部重点实验室、陕西省结构与抗震重点实验室、陕西省岩土与地下空间工程重点实验室、陕西省城市公共交通空间综合规划与开发工程研究中心、陕西省城市基础设施数字化工程技术研究中心、西部装配式建筑工业化陕西省</span>2011<span>协同创新中心等教学科研平台。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院现有教职工</span>190<span>余人，</span><span>其中正高级职称</span>50<span>人，</span><span>博士生导师</span></span><span><span>59</span></span><span><span>人。拥有教育部</span></span><span><span>“长江学者和创新团队发展计划”</span></span><span><span>创新团队</span>1<span>个，国家级教学团队</span><span>1</span><span>个，</span></span><span><span>中国科学院院士</span><span>1</span><span>人，</span></span><span><span>俄罗斯工程院外籍院士</span>1<span>人</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>国家杰出青年基金获得者</span>1<span>人，</span></span><span><span>“长江学者”</span><span>2</span><span>人，</span></span><span><span>国家</span></span><span><span>“万人计划”</span></span><span><span>入选者</span>3<span>人，</span></span><span><span>“百千万人才工程”国家</span></span><span><span>级人选</span>3<span>人，国家级教学名师</span><span>2</span><span>人，国务院学位委员会学科评议组成员</span><span>1</span><span>人，全国五一劳动奖章获得者</span><span>1</span><span>人，全国教材建设先进个人</span><span>1</span><span>人，全国高校青年教师教学竞赛一等奖获得者</span><span>1</span><span>人，</span></span><span><span>省部级</span></span><span><span>人才计划入选者</span>60<span>余人次。</span></span></p><p><span><span>土木工程学院作为我国土木工程领域重要的科学研究和人才培养基地，以引领学科发展和推动科技进步为目标，依托教育部、陕西省重点实验室及高水平创新团队，在高性能</span></span><span><span>材料与结构</span></span><span><span>、古建筑结构保护与传承、西部村镇建筑与绿色建造、结构韧性与智能防灾、工程结构智能诊断与长寿命保障、地下工程</span></span><span><span>安全</span></span><span><span>与智慧运维等方向优势明显、特色鲜明，曾获国家科技进步二等奖</span>4<span>项，先后培养了包括中国工程院院士吕西林</span></span><span><span>，中国科学院院士姚仰平，</span></span><span><span>全国劳动模范梁西军</span></span><span><span>、王洲亚</span></span><span><span>等为代表的一大批土木工程领域的知名专家学者和行业精英</span></span><span><span>，为国家经济建设和社会发展做出了重要贡献。</span></span></p><p><span><span>为了促进高校优秀大学生之间的学术交流，加强青年学生对西安建筑科技大学土木工程学院的了解，并在</span></span><span><span>2027</span><span>年研究生</span></span><span><span>招生政策方面为广大学子答疑解惑，西安建筑科技大学土木工程学院将于</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>17</span></span><span><span>日举办优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>一、申请资格</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>（一）在读的本校及外校</span></span><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>年级大学生；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，在校期间未受过纪律处分，身心健康；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（三）就读高校应具有推荐免试资格；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>）学习成绩优秀，本科前三年专业排名</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span>0%<span>以内或获得省部级创新创业竞赛二等奖及以上（有证书）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>五</span></span><span><span>）外语成绩优秀，英语四级成绩在</span>425<span>分以上或</span></span><span><span>具有</span></span><span><span>其他同等级别英语水平。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>二、申请流程</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>（一）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名需提交的申请材料</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1. <span>《西安建筑科技大学暑期夏令营申请表》</span><span>1</span><span>份（见附件，除签字手写外，其余信息均打印）；</span></span></p><p><span>2. <span>本科阶段前三年成绩单</span><span>1</span><span>份（加盖学校或者院系教务部门公章）；</span></span></p><p><span>3. </span><span><span>国家英语四、六级考试、</span>TOEFL、GRE/GMAT成绩等英语水平的证明</span><span><span>材料</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p><p><span>4. <span>其他需补充的支持材料</span><span>1</span><span>份</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>获奖证书、发表论文（或录用通知）、专利、出版物、或申请人能够证明自己在德智体美劳方面具有专长的材料。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>（二）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>申请程序</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1. <span>电子版材料提交</span></span></p><p><span><span>请将申请材料（按上述</span>1-</span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>的顺序）电子版用</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>暑期夏令营报名</span>+<span>姓名</span><span>+</span><span>本科在读高校</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>命名以压缩包的形式发送至电子邮箱</span>tm</span><span><span>yjs</span></span><span>@xauat.edu.cn<span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>材料提交后，在线填写</span></span><span><span>优秀研究生生源选拔暑期夏令营学员基本信息表</span></span><span><span>https://f.wps.cn/g/zY3JiGNJ/</span></span></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://yzb.xauat.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7MNUV4UzCsMzGPU2zVkMRMRUznfLm9dYMlCsUmQ2UlQfnR90gihFp2hmCIa0MYh7nShRUYyDnlLbM7-YMmliUNrRL8UPMmN4UNnVozLPL8VFUzNsMNQfMmWFLlQVL8lJv2bjo4OeosT/vsX46YhXptQ0g47aLmG0oR7sM1bw62-8c&amp;oid=1471287094&amp;tid=1020&amp;nid=8176&amp;e=.png\"/></p><p><span>2. </span><span><span>接收材料日期：</span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>11</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>-16</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>14:00</span></span><span><span>，逾期不再接受申请。申请材料发送后，请加入西建大土木</span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>夏令营</span>QQ<span>群。（群号：</span></span><span><span>1054649002</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p><p><br/> </p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://yzb.xauat.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7LmvVYLN-ZL4liL2RTkUmAfoRWRM8ldYn7LbUm94olQfo7U0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyZnky4nSy8LmvbUzr2nlCbLz-iLRGsMm-ZLmv8nmGYolVFoRnfUNr7LRnFLmQkMm9Jv2bjo4OeosT/vsX46YhXptQ0g47aLmG0oR7sM1bw62-8c&amp;oid=1471287094&amp;tid=1020&amp;nid=8176&amp;e=.png\"/></p><p><span>3. <span>材料审核</span></span></p><p><span><span>夏令营的材料审核工作将在</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>16</span><span>日下午</span></span><span><span>结束，入选学生名单将在</span>QQ<span>群公布，届时未在公布名单中的同学均为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>三、活动安排</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>本年度夏令营活动采用线上模式进行。</span></span><span><span>夏令营期间学院将安排学术报告、学术交流、师生互动等多种活动。</span></span><span><span>夏令营活动时间为</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>17</span><span>日（周五），具体安排如下：</span></span></p><p><span><span>8:30</span><span>—</span><span>11:00</span></span><span><span>：开幕式，学术沙龙（相关教授做专题学术报告，学生参与提问和互动）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>11:00</span><span>—</span><span>12:00</span><span>：师生交流。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>四、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>注意事项</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1. <span>学生所申报的各种信息和申请材料必须真实，如有弄虚作假现象，一经查实，取消</span></span><span><span>申请人所获得的</span></span><span><span>资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span>. </span><span><span>夏令营活动</span></span><span><span>坚持</span></span><span><span>“安全第一”原则，参加暑期夏令营活动的同学须遵守西安建筑科技大学的相关规</span></span><span><span>定</span></span><span><span>，并</span></span><span><span>注意</span></span><span><span>安全。</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>联系人：</span></span><span><span>张老师</span> <span>樊老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：</span>029-8220</span><span><span>3256</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span> <span><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://yzb.xauat.edu.cn/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://yzb.xauat.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&amp;owner=1471287094&amp;wbfileid=57DD9596E62B8140A0E4F8D2A7B9199D\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件：优秀研究生生源选拔暑期夏令营申请表.docx</a></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>西安建筑科技大学土木工程学院</span>  </span></p><p><span>                                                202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>11</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"52d9deb7fdb145275794baed87721d7677dd8e03a02368eef5d7e7bb4fc9bc79","textLength":2241,"sourceSha256":"c0940a250fa1b2cdc3e5844b3234666f77a4e4b2de05899626630cc149731310","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件：优秀研究生生源选拔暑期夏令营申请表.docx","url":"https://yzb.xauat.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1471287094&wbfileid=FFF17EE6E9D6E8BBC4B903AFD6777C20"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-51ebc8126c1d8b0654a3","title":"2026年西安建筑科技大学土木工程学院2027年优秀研究生生源选拔暑期夏令营通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:10.825465+00:00"}
